timeglance (3.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build as a proper Debian source package with debhelper and dh-python
    (pybuild), replacing the hand-assembled dpkg-deb build. The `timeglance`
    launcher is now the wheel's own console script, and dependencies, desktop
    entry, scalable icon, AppStream metainfo and copyright install the Debian
    way.

